Error: Jet.BuiltinRedefined: The trait name `Layout` is the marker `#Layout`
  --> Tests/UI/marker_trait_collision.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | Layout: trait {
    | ^^^^^^
 Why: A marker and a trait never share a name, so `#Layout` always means the one marker
 Fix: Choose a trait name that no marker has
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.BuiltinRedefined
